00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:19.930
version of the same thing to say, which is
essentially that Donald Trump's behavior,

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:24.140
as we now see it on Twitter, is compulsive
and obsessive.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.969
And it's a sort of decompensation of sorts.

00:03:26.969 --> 00:03:32.840
His behavior is the type of behavior that,
