00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.019
It's manic behavior.

00:03:44.019 --> 00:03:45.870
It's compulsive behavior.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.530
You might have some kind of an intervention.

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:50.689
There might be a psychiatric evaluation done
at a certain point.

00:03:50.689 --> 00:03:53.680
That's the type of behavior that we're seeing
from Donald Trump.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:58.159
Now, one last thing you might have noticed
that I didn't go through and read individual

