And there's no shortage of tweets that I could
have read.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:09.670
We are past the significance of any one of
Donald Trump's tweets in general.

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:15.409
Now, if Donald Trump tweets something that's
specifically newsworthy or actionable, if

00:04:15.409 --> 00:04:20.750
